  "title": "Vertiv launches utility-grade energy storage system to accelerate data center interconnection and grid resilience in North America",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global leader in critical digital infrastructure, today announced the Vertiv™ EnergyCore Grid, a modular, utility-grade battery energy storage system (BESS) now available in North America. Designed for data centers, education, and large commercial and industrial facilities, the Vertiv EnergyCore Grid delivers reliable, scalable energy storage that strengthens power resilience and accelerates interconnection in grid-constrained environments.",
